<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/msa@/~cl_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/msa@/~cl_1__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2017/28/msa@> .
